WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.733
Your roof, tonight.

00:02.433 --> 00:06.708
This is the sky over your own place as tonight's dark arrives.

00:07.158 --> 00:09.824
Every point of light up there is somewhere.

00:10.274 --> 00:17.423
We are going to fly out past all of them, and after the first lift off the ground the camera will not cut once.
